<title>USA: Brilliance China FY 96 share $0.40 vs 0.20.</title>
<headline>Brilliance China FY 96 share $0.40 vs 0.20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>				12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 Rmb3.3		   Rmb1.7</p>
<p> Net		 57,134		   29,571</p>
<p> Sales	     1,145,295		1,056,231</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  17,391		   17,391</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Currency is the Renminbi.)</p>
<p>NOTE:Earnings per share in U.S. dollars were $0.40 in 1996 and $0.20 in 1995. The exchange rate was translated at one dollar to 8.3 Renminbi.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Brilliance China Automotive Holdings Ltd, incorporated in Bermuda and based in Shenyang, China.</p>
